cff-version: 1.2.0
title: cpp-review-bench
message: >-
  A dual-track benchmark for C/C++ code review: measure both what your
  reviewer catches (defect track) and what it wrongly flags (contract track).
type: software
authors:
  - name: cpp-review-bench contributors
repository-code: 'https://github.com/Atituiset/cpp-review-bench'
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - code review
  - benchmark
  - static analysis
  - C
  - C++
  - contract-aware
  - false-positive
  - defect-detection
